## busybox vi — specification only, no code

BusyBox is distributed under **version 2 of the GNU General Public License**
(v2 only). **No BusyBox source code is present in this repository, and none is
translated into it.** `editors/vi.c` was read as a specification for command
behaviour, scope and edge cases; the JavaScript engine is written from the
observed behaviour and from `docs/target-surface.md`.

If any BusyBox-derived code ever needs to enter this repository, the project
must be relicensed as GPLv2 first. It has not been, and the intent is that it
never is: the design deliberately keeps busybox at the distance of a
*specification*.

